WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.991
Sums and products, one colour.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.110
Colour the whole numbers. Can a set's sums

3
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.132
and its products all share one colour?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.733
Products are tamed first; then a model

5
00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.666
of each colour steers the sums in.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.068
Claimed: yes, for sets of every finite size.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.398
Manuscript only, no Lean.
